{"id":"f798fc3990a5c443","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-snake.md","title":"Snake Lemma","display":"thm-snake — Snake Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-snake","aliases":["58-thm-snake"],"display":"thm-snake — Snake Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[58-df-abelian-category.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-snake"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-snake</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-snake — Snake Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"58-df-abelian-category.md\">58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定范畴参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;,Z_0,f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(A,B,C,A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;,Z_0,f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(h)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,h)\">\\(s(h)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,h)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(h)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,h)\">\\(t(h)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,h)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kh=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,k,h)\">\\(kh=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,k,h)\\)</span>，均仅在下面显示的类型前提下使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z,A,f,B,g,C,Z&#39;)\">\\(\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z,A,f,B,g,C,Z&#39;)\\)</span> 是此固定范畴内的七元兼容接口；书内原有的六元模论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S\\)</span> 定义不变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 与一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exact}\">\\(\\operatorname{Exact}\\)</span> 的编码约定由下面等价式给出；有限态射串编码为对象序列与箭头序列的有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>核、余核、单态射、满态射、正合对全部使用内部泛性质定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CokernelIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{CokernelIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"58-df-abelian-category.md\">58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}short\\text{-}exact\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z,A,f,B,g,C,Z&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z&#39;,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A,B,C\\in O\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\n\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\land\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}short\\text{-}exact\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z,A,f,B,g,C,Z&#39;)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z&#39;,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land A,B,C\\in O\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\n\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\land\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}commutative\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S(f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land t(f)=s(g)\\land t(f&#39;)=s(g&#39;)\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(f),s(f&#39;))\n\\land\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),t(f&#39;))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(g),t(g&#39;))\n\\land\\beta f=f&#39;\\alpha\\land\\gamma g=g&#39;\\beta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}commutative\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S(f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\land t(f)=s(g)\\land t(f&#39;)=s(g&#39;)\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(f),s(f&#39;))\n\\land\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),t(f&#39;))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(g),t(g&#39;))\n\\land\\beta f=f&#39;\\alpha\\land\\gamma g=g&#39;\\beta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}finite\\text{-}exact\\text{-}string}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Exact}(\\langle\\vec A,\\vec f\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,n+1,O)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,n,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(\\vec f(j)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\vec A(j),\\vec A(j+1)))\n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(j+1&lt;n\\to\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(\\vec f(j),\\vec f(j+1),\\mathcal C))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}finite\\text{-}exact\\text{-}string}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{Exact}(\\langle\\vec A,\\vec f\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,n+1,O)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,n,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(\\vec f(j)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\vec A(j),\\vec A(j+1)))\n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(j+1&lt;n\\to\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(\\vec f(j),\\vec f(j+1),\\mathcal C))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}snake}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z_0,A,f,B,g,C,Z_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z_0,A&#39;,f&#39;,B&#39;,g&#39;,C&#39;,Z_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S(f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\longrightarrow\\exists k_\\alpha,k_\\beta,k_\\gamma,q_\\alpha,q_\\beta,q_\\gamma,u,v,\\delta,w,z,z_L,z_R\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\beta,\\beta,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\gamma,\\gamma,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\beta,\\beta,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\gamma,\\gamma,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\alpha),s(k_\\beta))\n\\land v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\beta),s(k_\\gamma))\n\\land\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\gamma),t(q_\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q_\\alpha),t(q_\\beta))\n\\land z\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q_\\beta),t(q_\\gamma))\n\\land k_\\beta u=fk_\\alpha\\land k_\\gamma v=gk_\\beta\n\\land wq_\\alpha=q_\\beta f&#39;\\land zq_\\beta=q_\\gamma g&#39;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(z_L,Z_0,s(k_\\alpha),\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(z_R,t(q_\\gamma),Z_0,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Exact}\\!\\left(\n\\left\\langle\n\\langle Z_0,s(k_\\alpha),s(k_\\beta),s(k_\\gamma),t(q_\\alpha),t(q_\\beta),t(q_\\gamma),Z_0\\rangle,\n\\langle z_L,u,v,\\delta,w,z,z_R\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}snake}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z_0,A,f,B,g,C,Z_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z_0,A&#39;,f&#39;,B&#39;,g&#39;,C&#39;,Z_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S(f,g,f&#39;,g&#39;,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\longrightarrow\\exists k_\\alpha,k_\\beta,k_\\gamma,q_\\alpha,q_\\beta,q_\\gamma,u,v,\\delta,w,z,z_L,z_R\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\beta,\\beta,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\gamma,\\gamma,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\beta,\\beta,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\gamma,\\gamma,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\alpha),s(k_\\beta))\n\\land v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\beta),s(k_\\gamma))\n\\land\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\gamma),t(q_\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q_\\alpha),t(q_\\beta))\n\\land z\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q_\\beta),t(q_\\gamma))\n\\land k_\\beta u=fk_\\alpha\\land k_\\gamma v=gk_\\beta\n\\land wq_\\alpha=q_\\beta f&#39;\\land zq_\\beta=q_\\gamma g&#39;\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(z_L,Z_0,s(k_\\alpha),\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(z_R,t(q_\\gamma),Z_0,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Exact}\\!\\left(\n\\left\\langle\n\\langle Z_0,s(k_\\alpha),s(k_\\beta),s(k_\\gamma),t(q_\\alpha),t(q_\\beta),t(q_\\gamma),Z_0\\rangle,\n\\langle z_L,u,v,\\delta,w,z,z_R\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>结论中的四个非连接箭头通过与核嵌入、余核投影的交换等式确定，不能任意另选一条正合串冒充原图诱导的序列。</li>\n<li>不把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ker\">\\(\\ker\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{coker}\">\\(\\operatorname{coker}\\)</span> 当成没有选择规则的对象函数；量化的是满足泛性质的箭头。</li>\n<li>七元的固定范畴兼容记号与已有六元模短正合谓词按元数区分；后者的文件及接口没有改动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Category}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}$、$\\mathrm{CokernelIn}$、$\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}$、$\\mathrm{KernelIn}$、$\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}$、$\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}$、$\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}$ 取 [[58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C,A',B',C',Z_0,f,g,f',g',\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"O=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"M=\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"s(h)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,h)","display":false},{"tex":"t(h)=\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,h)","display":false},{"tex":"kh=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,k,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z,A,f,B,g,C,Z')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exact}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CokernelIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}short\\text{-}exact\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z,A,f,B,g,C,Z')\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{ZeroObjectIn}_S(Z',\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land A,B,C\\in O\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\n\\land g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,C)\\land\\mathrm{ShortExactIn}_S(f,g,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}commutative\\text{-}diagram}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S(f,g,f',g',\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land f,g,f',g',\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in M\\\\\n&\\land t(f)=s(g)\\land t(f')=s(g')\n\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(f),s(f'))\n\\land\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(f),t(f'))\\\\\n&\\land\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(g),t(g'))\n\\land\\beta f=f'\\alpha\\land\\gamma g=g'\\beta.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}snake\\text{-}finite\\text{-}exact\\text{-}string}\\vdash{}&\n\\operatorname{Exact}(\\langle\\vec A,\\vec f\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,n+1,O)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec f,n,M)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(\\vec f(j)\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(\\vec A(j),\\vec A(j+1)))\n\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;(j+1<n\\to\\mathrm{ExactPairIn}_S(\\vec f(j),\\vec f(j+1),\\mathcal C))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}snake}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{AbelianCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z_0,A,f,B,g,C,Z_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{ShortExact}_S(Z_0,A',f',B',g',C',Z_0)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{CommutativeMorphismDiagram}_S(f,g,f',g',\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)\\\\\n&\\longrightarrow\\exists k_\\alpha,k_\\beta,k_\\gamma,q_\\alpha,q_\\beta,q_\\gamma,u,v,\\delta,w,z,z_L,z_R\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\beta,\\beta,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{KernelIn}_S(k_\\gamma,\\gamma,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\beta,\\beta,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{CokernelIn}_S(q_\\gamma,\\gamma,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\alpha),s(k_\\beta))\n\\land v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\beta),s(k_\\gamma))\n\\land\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(s(k_\\gamma),t(q_\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q_\\alpha),t(q_\\beta))\n\\land z\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t(q_\\beta),t(q_\\gamma))\n\\land k_\\beta u=fk_\\alpha\\land k_\\gamma v=gk_\\beta\n\\land wq_\\alpha=q_\\beta f'\\land zq_\\beta=q_\\gamma g'\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(z_L,Z_0,s(k_\\alpha),\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZeroArrowIn}_S(z_R,t(q_\\gamma),Z_0,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\operatorname{Exact}\\!\\left(\n\\left\\langle\n\\langle Z_0,s(k_\\alpha),s(k_\\beta),s(k_\\gamma),t(q_\\alpha),t(q_\\beta),t(q_\\gamma),Z_0\\rangle,\n\\langle z_L,u,v,\\delta,w,z,z_R\\rangle\n\\right\\rangle\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\ker","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{coker}","display":false}],"bytes":4945,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4424","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-snake.md|58-thm-snake]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c","2aed7ac2ed3313e0","e637becf421e4e61","36d7463d215be751"]}